{
  "$comment": "Workstream file ownership (kadolakay-plan.md \u00a71). A PR from branch ws<N>/* may only touch files owned by ws<N> or listed in 'shared'. Most specific (longest) matching pattern wins. Update via a WS0 PR. A PR labelled 'ownership-override' (e.g. the WS0 bootstrap that creates src/lib/log.ts for WS8) skips the check; reviewers must justify it in the PR body.",
